{"id":"f341fbb666f74df3","group":"58","path":"58/batch12/58-df-zfc-top6-closed-map.md","title":"ZFC Top6 Closed Map","display":"df-zfc-top6-closed-map — ZFC Top6 Closed Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-top6-closed-map","aliases":["58-df-zfc-top6-closed-map"],"display":"df-zfc-top6-closed-map — ZFC Top6 Closed Map","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-function]]","[[58-df-zfc-rel-image]]","[[58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference]]","[[58-df-topological-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-top6-closed-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-top6-closed-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-top6-closed-map — ZFC Top6 Closed Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c189b9b31702b9de\" href=\"?note=c189b9b31702b9de\" title=\"58-df-zfc-rel-image\">58-df-zfc-rel-image</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"90335d0f6a9bc60f\" href=\"?note=90335d0f6a9bc60f\" title=\"58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference\">58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau\">\\(X,\\tau\\)</span> (domain topological space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Y,\\sigma\">\\(Y,\\sigma\\)</span> (codomain topological space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f\">\\(f\\)</span> (function, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (three-argument function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"58-df-function\">58-df-function</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f[F]\">\\(f[F]\\)</span> (image operation, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c189b9b31702b9de\" href=\"?note=c189b9b31702b9de\" title=\"58-df-zfc-rel-image\">58-df-zfc-rel-image</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"815e63e5071e7b58\" href=\"?note=815e63e5071e7b58\" title=\"58-df-topological-space\">58-df-topological-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedMap}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedMap}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top6\\text{-}closed\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedMap}_S(X,\\tau,Y,\\sigma,f)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall F\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl((X\\setminus F)\\in\\tau\\to(Y\\setminus f[F])\\in\\sigma\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}top6\\text{-}closed\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcTop6ClosedMap}_S(X,\\tau,Y,\\sigma,f)\\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\sigma)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,X,Y)\\land\\forall F\\subseteq X\\;\\bigl((X\\setminus F)\\in\\tau\\to(Y\\setminus f[F])\\in\\sigma\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The function graph is checked by the upstream three-argument predicate before its set image is used.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-rel-image","status":"resolved","id":"c189b9b31702b9de","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-rel-image]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference","status":"resolved","id":"90335d0f6a9bc60f","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-setop-set-difference]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-topological-space","status":"resolved","id":"815e63e5071e7b58","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-topological-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$f$ (function, see [[58-df-function]])","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-function","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-7","